  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1204.75 Wood furniture coating operation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1204.75 \"Wood furniture coating operation\" means the surface coating of products that belong to the same wood furniture industrial grouping and which are identified in the North American Industry Classification System Manual, 2002, by the following codes:\n\n(a) 33711;\n\n(b) 44211;\n\n(c) 337121;\n\n(d) 337122;\n\n(e) 337125;\n\n(f) 337127;\n\n(g) 337129;\n\n(h) 337211;\n\n(i) 337212;\n\n(j) 337215; and\n\n(k) 339111.",
